    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can\u2019t control your speed, only your steering. Stripped down to this simple yet demanding mechanic, every drift becomes a test of focus, and every parry with your shield keeps the journey alive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Navigate through abstract mindscapes inspired by psychedelic and retro-futuristic aesthetics of the 1980s. From synthwave to deep space and cyberpunk, experience a unique music-driven journey.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >First, explore each level at your own rhythm, learning every mechanic. Once you\u2019ve mastered everything, embark on Rush Mode, a continuous run across all levels that will unlock the path to the ultimate challenge waiting at the end.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can\u2019t control your speed, only your steering. Stripped down to this simple yet demanding mechanic, every drift becomes a test of focus, and every parry with your shield keeps the journey alive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Navigate through abstract mindscapes inspired by psychedelic and retro-futuristic aesthetics of the 1980s. From synthwave to deep space and cyberpunk, experience a unique music-driven journey.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >First, explore each level at your own rhythm, learning every mechanic. Once you\u2019ve mastered everything, embark on Rush Mode, a continuous run across all levels that will unlock the path to the ultimate challenge waiting at the end.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
